{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47282","headline":"游仙二十四首 十九 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝逾弱水北，夕憩锺山顶。\n颛顼清玄宫，禺强扫幽境。\n烛龙发神曜，阴野弥焕炳。\n导达三气和，驱除六天静。\n玉楼互相晖，烟客何秀頴。\n一举流霞津，千年在俄倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}